  "id": "metamemory",
  "term": "metamemory",
  "definition": "Metamemory is a person’s awareness of their own memory and their ability to monitor, judge, and manage memory-related thinking and behavior. It includes understanding memory states such as knowing, remembering, and forgetting, and is closely linked to learning and everyday memory use.",
